---
title: "accrue_interest (Current Finance: Reserve Interest)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_time: last_updated == now?
    q_check_time --> q_skip: already accrued, return
    q_check_time --> q_calc_util: util_rate = debt / (cash + debt - cash_reserve)
    q_skip --> [*]
    q_calc_util --> q_calc_rate: interest_rate = calc_interest(model, util_rate)
    q_calc_rate --> q_calc_factor: simple_interest_factor = rate * (now - last_updated)
    q_calc_factor --> q_calc_accumulated: interest_accumulated = debt * factor
    q_calc_accumulated --> q_update_debt: debt = debt + interest_accumulated
    q_update_debt --> q_update_reserve: cash_reserve += reserve_factor * interest_accumulated
    q_update_reserve --> q_update_index: borrow_index = factor * old_index + old_index
    q_update_index --> q_set_time: borrow_index.set_value(new_index, now)
    q_set_time --> [*]

    note right of q_update_index
        INV-001: borrow_index is monotonically increasing
        INV-002: debt increases by interest_accumulated on every accrual
        INV-003: cash_reserve accumulates protocol's share of interest
        INV-004: Idempotent within same timestamp (skips if already accrued)
        INV-005: simple interest formula: new_index = old_index * (1 + rate * dt)
    end note
